ading to detect the trained object (face).  There are 3 steps involved: Training, Testing and Prediction. A persons image will be captured in different light intensities and pose. These images are stored in the database. This is training. When the person faces the camera, his/her images will be verified with that of the trained images in the database. This is testing. The final step is the prediction, which tells us if it is a success ( when there is a match between the image captured and the images in the database) or a failure ( when there is no match between the image captured and the images in the database).","topics":[],"score":286068,"global_rank":29514,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6194},{"name":"aerissecure/pyness","owner":"aerissecure","html_url":"https://github.com/aerissecure/pyness","stars":6,"forks":2,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python library for interacting with Nessus scanner and parsing scan results","topics":[],"score":286065,"global_rank":29518,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6195},{"name":"zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","owner":"zaro0508","html_url":"https://github.com/zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"A set of Sceptre resolvers to help identify a stack","topics":[],"score":286055,"global_rank":29525,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6196},{"name":"moltenform/labs_coordinate_music","owner":"moltenform","html_url":"https://github.com/moltenform/labs_coordinate_music","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Tools to keep a local music library tidy, optionally by using metadata from Spotify.","topics":[],"score":286051,"global_rank":29528,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6197},{"name":"rcpeene/Potions-And-Pythons","owner":"rcpeene","html_url":"https://github.com/rcpeene/Potions-And-Pythons","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"lan